  "acceptance_controls": [
    "Exact server/client JSON schemas retain min2 operators/min1 edge and singleton leaf, with no mandatory fan-out.",
    "Minimal A1 to B1, A2 to B3 rebalance and A2 to B2 to C2 plan round trips preserve physical identity and metadata-only state.",
    "Source-only, fan-in, schema mismatch, same operator port UID and wrong forward parallelism remain refused.",
    "Actual protected Prefect TCP SDK sync/async seal, exact replay and read pass for the mandatory A1/B1/C2 fixture and both requested linear shapes; physical TaskRun counts are 4,5,6 respectively, with no grants, records or physical slot allocation.",
    "Actual SQLite TCP sync/async public requests remain typed UNSUPPORTED_BACKEND before topology creation.",
    "Stripped wheel and source imports guard server-only modules and explicitly verify the new minimum schema bounds; no business function is invoked."
  ],
  "unchanged": [
    "Existing submit_partitioned_stream and PartitionedStream fixed-P2 typing/behavior.",
    "Public descriptor signatures, explicit seal/read-only boundary and metadata-preview operational documentation.",
    "Earlier572 contract, package and live-HTTP archives remain immutable predecessors and were not redundantly rerun."
  ],
  "operational_boundary": "Metadata preview only: no public admission/start/wait, no usable DAG Flow lifecycle, terminal Flow transitions refuse DAG_NOT_STARTED. Draft/unmerged through NI2-012; no DATA/routing/worker execution or full-completion claim.",
